    "conclusion": "Families in Kota Kinabalu, Kuching, Miri and Kuantan have the same ambitions as families in Mont Kiara, with fewer schools to reach them. The end of primary school is when an international route becomes a free choice, and the exam calendar is what makes it work or not. Plan the subjects, the series and the university together, and distance stops being the deciding factor. If that is where your family is, book an assessment for your child."
