    "conclusion": "The end of SMP is when a family’s choice becomes open, and distance from Jakarta is what usually narrows it. Neither needs to decide the outcome. Choose the route, IGCSE and A-Level, the IB, AP or an international programme with Paket C, against the university the student is aiming at, then plan the exam series around the journey. The teaching reaches every province the same way. When you are ready, book an assessment for your child."
